```

If there is no single 6-seat table:

```text
T-01 + T-02
```

can satisfy 5 guests.

The general goal:

1. Find enough total capacity
2. Prefer fewer tables
3. Prefer the smallest sufficient combined capacity
4. Respect table availability
5. Respect table status
6. Respect section restrictions/preferences
7. Never use blocked/occupied/unavailable tables

