# 70. FINAL TEST MATRIX

Test at minimum:

### Guest capacity

```text
1 guest → 1 table
4 guests → 1 × 4-seat table
5 guests → 2 × 4-seat tables
8 guests → 2 × 4-seat tables
9 guests → 3 × 4-seat tables
```

### Duration

```text
30 min
60 min
90 min
120 min
180 min
```

### Pricing

```text
1 table × 30 min × 50 = 50
1 table × 60 min × 50 = 100
2 tables × 60 min × 50 = 200
2 tables × 120 min × 50 = 400
```

### Time

```text
7:00 → 8:00
7:00 → 9:00
7:30 → 9:00
```

### Closing

```text
10:00 → 11:00 = valid
10:00 → 12:00 = invalid if restaurant closes 11:00
```

### Overlap

```text
7–9 existing
8–10 requested
→ reject

7–9 existing
9–11 requested
→ potentially valid
```

### Payment

```text
No receipt → cannot submit

No transaction ID → cannot submit

Customer tries changing amount → impossible

Payment submitted → Pending Verification

Admin verifies → Confirmed

Admin rejects → Rejected
```

### Account

```text
Customer creates reservation
→ My Reservations shows it

Admin changes status
→ Customer sees updated status
```

